WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:03.837 --> 00:00:05.880
What did you just say?

00:00:06.464 --> 00:00:07.882
Leave this place.

00:00:07.966 --> 00:00:10.552
You want to see what
the afterlife looks like or something?

00:00:10.635 --> 00:00:12.012
More like

00:00:12.095 --> 00:00:15.432
people in the afterlife
say that you're a nuisance.

00:00:17.058 --> 00:00:18.351
Stupid kid!

00:00:18.435 --> 00:00:21.021
Ryu isn't scared of any spirits!

00:00:21.104 --> 00:00:22.063
That's right.

00:00:22.147 --> 00:00:24.733
-If you think you can take me on--
-"Then come and get some"?

00:00:24.816 --> 00:00:25.984
-What?
-What?

00:00:26.568 --> 00:00:30.071
There's someone who's been
itching for a fight for a while now.

00:00:30.572 --> 00:00:31.531
Isn't that right…

00:00:35.660 --> 00:00:36.578
Amidamaru?

00:00:36.661 --> 00:00:38.913
It's a spirit samurai!

00:00:38.997 --> 00:00:40.623
I am most grateful

00:00:40.707 --> 00:00:45.045
for this opportunity
to get revenge after such disgrace,

00:00:45.712 --> 00:00:46.546
Master Yoh.

00:00:46.629 --> 00:00:48.631
Don't tell me this spirit

00:00:48.715 --> 00:00:51.551
is the owner of that broken grave,

00:00:52.135 --> 00:00:53.303
Amidamaru!

00:00:53.386 --> 00:00:55.221
The legendary samurai!

00:00:55.805 --> 00:00:57.307
Hey.

00:00:57.390 --> 00:00:59.768
Not this Amidamaru crap again.

00:00:59.851 --> 00:01:02.771
I knew it! He's just a spirit, after all…

00:01:03.521 --> 00:01:06.608
-Kill them!
-Yes, sir!

00:01:07.192 --> 00:01:08.109
Okay.

00:01:08.193 --> 00:01:09.694
Let's show them a thing or two.

00:01:10.278 --> 00:01:11.821
-Right, Amidamaru?
-Yes.

00:01:12.614 --> 00:01:15.033
When your technique is combined with mine,

00:01:15.617 --> 00:01:17.327
we're invincible!

00:01:18.536 --> 00:01:19.537
Amidamaru!

00:01:19.621 --> 00:01:20.497
Spirit Flame Mode!

00:01:22.457 --> 00:01:23.666
I told you, didn't I?

00:01:23.750 --> 00:01:25.960
I connect this world with the next.

00:01:26.044 --> 00:01:27.545
That's what a Shaman does!

00:01:28.797 --> 00:01:29.714
Let's go!

00:01:29.798 --> 00:01:31.382
Spirit Integrate!

00:01:33.676 --> 00:01:37.097
The Spirit Flame is going inside his body!

00:01:48.566 --> 00:01:50.276
Spirit Integrate?

00:01:50.360 --> 00:01:51.903
As in possession?

00:01:51.986 --> 00:01:53.071
Possession…

00:01:53.655 --> 00:01:55.406
"The state of being
controlled by a spirit."

00:01:55.990 --> 00:02:00.286
Don't tell me that's what he meant
by "joining this world with the next!"

00:02:02.163 --> 00:02:04.290
This ought to be plenty
for the likes of you.

00:02:06.376 --> 00:02:08.378
All right! Now it's my turn.

00:02:08.962 --> 00:02:10.255
Are you ready?

